  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Category:</strong> Luxury<br>\n<strong>Fabrication:</strong> DV29 - 5,000eb - 1 Month<br>\n<strong>Enhances:</strong> Skinweave or Subdermal Armor<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p>Iconic Skinweave or Subdermal Armor Cyberware Enhancement. The enhanced armor's SP goes up by 4. The trade: while that armor sits at full SP, the first ablation it takes costs 1 extra SP. It can't raise Dragoon Plating's SP.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Iconic: it can't be bought or sourced on the street, can't be fabricated without its Blueprint, can't be taken during Character Generation, and once acquired can't be destroyed unless the player agrees to it beforehand.</li>\n<li>The price is the Luxury benchmark, for working out repairs and Tech Upgrades. Iconics can't be bought.</li>\n<li>Change the SP on the armor item for the skinweave or subdermal armor by hand; an upgrade installed in cyberware can't do it.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Becoming Iconic &gt; Iconic Cyberware).</em></p>"
